        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are a LinkedIn content strategist.\n\nBelow is SOURCE CONTENT. Use ONLY this source content. Do not use the instructions themselves as source material. Do not invent facts.\n\nSOURCE CONTENT:\n{{ $json.content }}\n\nGenerate exactly 3 LinkedIn post ideas.\n\nFor each idea provide:\n\n<topic1>\nA specific LinkedIn post topic based directly on the source content.\n\n<research1>\nSpecify exactly which facts, examples, statistics, sources, arguments, or sections from the source content should be used to write the post.\n\n<topic2>\n...\n\n<research2>\n...\n\n<topic3>\n...\n\n<research3>\n...\n\nRules:\n- Generate exactly 3 ideas.\n- Each idea must be substantially different.\n- Use only information contained in SOURCE CONTENT.\n- Do not create generic topics unrelated to the source.\n- Research references must point to specific information in the source.\n- Do not write the actual LinkedIn posts yet.\n- Do not add explanations before or after the 3 ideas.\n- Do not output JSON.\nImportant\nYour input contains a huge amount of text. That's fine.\n\nThe key is this:\n\nSOURCE CONTENT:\n{{ $json.content }}\nnot:\n\ncontent: [object Object]\nand not:\n\n{{ $json }}\n"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b4651bde-e380-41c3-bf07-5b179f945b54",
